WEBVTT

00:10:29.383 --> 00:10:30.717
Itatuhitaji sisi sote.

00:10:31.114 --> 00:10:33.760
Lakini tunayo fursa adimu
ya kujaribu,

00:10:33.784 --> 00:10:38.255
na kuamini sisi pia, kama wazazi,
tunajukumu la kufanya hivi.

00:10:39.644 --> 00:10:41.636
Halafu pale wote tunapoulizwa,

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.279
"Unafanya kazi gani?"

00:10:43.303 --> 00:10:46.223
kila mmoja wetu anaweza kusema,

00:10:46.247 --> 00:10:48.374
" Ninabadilisha mwelekeo wa historia
ya binadamu.

00:10:48.795 --> 00:10:52.195
Ninafanya kwa sehemu kutokomeza
ukatili dhidi ya watoto."

00:10:52.633 --> 00:10:54.847
Hebu tufanye hili na tufanye sasa.

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:56.411
Asanteni.

00:10:56.435 --> 00:11:02.230
(Makofi)